msgid "What&#8217;s new?"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"We just released 1.0.1.Final to fix an important security issue introduced "
"in CR2 and still present in 1.0.0.Final."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Please upgrade to this version as soon as possible if you are using our "
"security layer."
msgstr ""

msgid "Security issue fix"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"If you are using our security annotations (e.g. `@RolesAllowed`) and also "
"other annotations (such as Bean Validation annotations) on the parameters of "
"your secured methods, the security checks would entirely be bypassed."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"This issue was originally reported here: https://github.com/quarkusio/"
"quarkus/issues/5763 ."
msgstr ""

msgid "1.0.1.Final fixes this issue and upgrade is highly recommended."
msgstr ""

msgid "Full changelog"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"You can get https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/releases/tag/1.0.1."
"Final[the full changelog of 1.0.1.Final on GitHub]."
msgstr ""

msgid "Come Join Us"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"We value your feedback a lot so please report bugs, ask for improvements... "
"Let's build something great together!"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"If you are a Quarkus user or just curious, don't be shy and join our "
"welcoming community:"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"provide feedback on https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/issues[GitHub];"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"craft some code and https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/pulls[push a PR];"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"discuss with us on https://quarkusio.zulipchat.com/[Zulip] and on the https:/"
"/groups.google.com/d/forum/quarkus-dev[mailing list];"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"ask your questions on https://stackoverflow.com/questions/tagged/"
"quarkus[Stack Overflow]."
